Z||000001||Wolfhound||07-01-2000||07:09 AM||||Number two: I had this problem with a 2.5 automatic. Bad motor mounts were letting the bolts on the waterpump pully hit the battery tray. I looked everywhere before finding a small shiny spot on the tray. <BR>the motor would shift right when i turned left.<BR>Coy<p>[This message has been edited by Wolfhound (edited 07-01-2000).]||||reg||1
